  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_002
    Text: Regular 002
  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_003
    Text: Regular 003
  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_004
    Text: Regular 004
  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_005
    Text: Regular 005
  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_006
    Text: Regular 006
  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_007
    Text: Regular 007
  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_008
    Text: Regular 008
  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_009
    Text: Regular 009
  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_010
    Text: Regular 010
  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_011
    Text: Regular 011
  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_012
    Text: Regular 012
  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_013
    Text: Regular 013
  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_014
    Text: Regular 014
  - Name: Mob_Regular_World_015
    Text: Regular 015
  - Name: Gear_Head_V1_001
    Text: New warrior helmet. Solid as rock.
  - Name: Gear_Body_V1_002
    Text: Your first armor. Touch as steel.
  - Name: Gear_Leg_V1_003
    Text: Protect your leg. Soft hard to walk.
  - Name: Gear_MH_V1_004
    Text: Strong sword for new warrior from Saikis inheritance. Easy to use.
  - Name: Gear_OH_V1_005
    Text: Light shield to protect your human and yourself.
  - Name: Gear_Accessory_V1_149
    Text: New invention from tech lab. Wear in wirst as communication machine.
  - Name: Gear_Head_V2_001
    Text: A gift from earth with power of life.
  - Name: Gear_Body_V2_002
    Text: The earth protects its human by giving them life
  - Name: Gear_Leg_V2_003
    Text: Embrace your leg, let you walk further.
  - Name: Gear_Head_V3_001
    Text: New warrior helmet. Solid as rock.
  - Name: Gear_Body_V3_002
    Text: "It\u2019s been here to hold up your soul."
  - Name: Gear_Leg_V3_003
    Text: Slightly resist dark magic.
  - Name: Gear_Head_00_006
    Text: Wild energy make you crazy, but also let your mind more clear
  - Name: Gear_Body_00_007
    Text: "A bit heavy armor from some brutal thugs. It\u2019s make you become a
      little bit stronger"
  - Name: Gear_Leg_00_008
    Text: Run slower but counter better. Thug life.
  - Name: Gear_MH_00_009
    Text: A cruel weapon used to protect others
  - Name: Gear_OH_00_010
    Text: Normal shield, reduce a bit magic and physic attack.
  - Name: Gear_Head_00_011
    Text: Head of a monster forged by Saikis secret arts.
  - Name: Gear_Body_00_012
    Text: Special thank to Alen who create this wonderful pieces. It can protect
      you from both magical and physical attack.
  - Name: Gear_Leg_00_013
    Text: "Bug-like design look so crazy but it\u2019s work."
  - Name: Gear_MH_00_014
    Text: A big guy who looks like he's about to chew on his enemy's head
  - Name: Gear_OH_00_015
    Text: Royal Shield, Medal of Honor for Courage, resist a bit physical attack.
  - Name: Gear_Head_00_041
    Text: Something light and attract magic for rookie
  - Name: Gear_Body_00_042
    Text: Softly protect you from magic attack
  - Name: Gear_Leg_00_043
    Text: Rookie uniform look not bad, right?
  - Name: Gear_MH_00_044
    Text: Anyone can pick it up, but only magicians can fully use it
  - Name: Gear_OH_00_045
    Text: Hear the sound of magic, and attract them to new magician.
  - Name: Gear_Head_00_046
    Text: "Some magical hat that help you to connect with magic easily. And it\u2019s
      blue"
  - Name: Gear_Body_00_047
    Text: An other Saikis armor that is very nice to magic user.
  - Name: Gear_Leg_00_048
    Text: Simply trouser with some magical technique to make it harder
  - Name: Gear_MH_00_049
    Text: Magic is calling you, listen? Oh, you need an excellent staff, me, to help
      you deal with them
  - Name: Gear_OH_00_050
    Text: Smol pocket increase a smol amount of gold recieved.
  - Name: Gear_Head_00_051
    Text: Harlequin hat keeps your smile always on your face, forever.
  - Name: Gear_Body_00_052
    Text: Blue magic armor keeps you a little bit MP
  - Name: Gear_Leg_00_053
    Text: Blue trouser with some new technology to help reducing magical attack
  - Name: Gear_MH_00_054
    Text: Color is blue, power is cruel. Absorb small amount of enemy life point.
  - Name: Gear_OH_00_055
    Text: Ring ding dong! The party has start! Wave your bell to keep firing.
  - Name: Gear_Head_00_081
    Text: Simply cap, cover your face, suitable to doing shady things.
  - Name: Gear_Body_00_082
    Text: Like a green shadow, with no effect.
  - Name: Gear_Leg_00_083
    Text: You better run, run, run! A green wind blow over city.
  - Name: Gear_MH_00_084
    Text: The knife of light and dark. It kills your enemy, but noone know when it
      kill back to you.
  - Name: Gear_OH_00_085
    Text: Money is goal of life. Dropping it all to mine.
  - Name: Gear_Head_00_086
    Text: Become everyone you want, and lost yourself behind the mask.
  - Name: Gear_Body_00_087
    Text: Fit any body with comfortable feeling. Increase a bit defend.
  - Name: Gear_Leg_00_088
    Text: "Althought it\u2019s mucht lighter than normal, it just raise a little
      bit speed,"
  - Name: Gear_MH_00_089
    Text: All loser under this knife have 3 hole in their dead-body.
  - Name: Gear_OH_00_090
    Text: Symbol of underground life in city.
  - Name: Gear_Head_00_091
    Text: Wanderes hate showing their face, actually they hate everythings even themself.
  - Name: Gear_Body_00_092
    Text: Wandering to the horizon in a romantic vest, enemies encountered will be
      so sad.
  - Name: Gear_Leg_00_093
    Text: Perseverance with every step in your endless journey.
